    ('Speaker 1', 'We will also slow down on dates. Wrong dates in a demand or pleading create avoidable fights later.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'That is fine. I would rather spend the hour now than fix a defective paper next month.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Please keep your phone on silent but nearby in case a document or screenshot arrives while we talk.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'It is on silent. If finance or the site clerk texts, I will show you the message before I answer.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Good. When we finish, I will email a short privileged attendance note of decisions and homework.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'Please copy only the people who need it. No wide forwards from my side either.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Now the document walk-through — we will name each annexure so the bundle stays stable if this escalates.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I have most of it electronically. Hard copies can follow tomorrow if the scans are unclear.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'If a scan is skewed or incomplete, say so now rather than discovering it on the eve of filing.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I will flag anything blurry. I would rather rescan tonight.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'On without-prejudice conversations — if the other side calls you directly, redirect them to me and do not negotiate figures on WhatsApp.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'Understood. No side deals, no casual admissions.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'If you need a break for water or to take a short call, say so. These meetings run long for a reason.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I am fine to continue. Better we finish the substance in one sitting.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Then let us pressure-test the weak points the other side will attack first.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'Yes — tell me where our story is thinnest so I can plug holes with documents.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'We should also diary the next internal checkpoint, not only the external deadline.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'Put both on my calendar. I will make the same entries when I leave.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Any political, reputational, or family sensitivities that should stay out of formal papers — say them now so we lock privilege.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I will name them expressly before we close so there is no ambiguity.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Finally, confirm authority — are you the decision-maker on settlement ranges, or do you need a board or spouse?'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I can decide within what we discussed; anything beyond that I escalate and come back to you.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'That is enough mandate clarity for me to draft. We will not exceed it without fresh instructions.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'Agreed. Draft first, then I approve, then service or filing.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'One more pass on money figures — say the key numbers aloud once so the recording and my note match.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I will repeat the headline figures slowly.'),
    ('Speaker 1', "And one more pass on the factual chronology — start, middle, trigger event, today's status."),
    ('Speaker 2', 'Starting again from the beginning of the chronology as I understand it.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'If anything in that chronology is estimate rather than knowledge, label it as estimate.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I will separate what I saw myself from what staff told me.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Witnesses — who is willing, who is reluctant, and who must be protected from workplace blowback.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I will be honest about that. Some people will help quietly, not publicly.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Quiet help can still matter at this stage through documents even if they never take the stand.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'That is useful to hear.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Costs and disbursements — I will stage them so you approve each filing tranche.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'Please. No surprise filings.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'If urgent developments happen after we leave — lock-out, sale threat, new letter — call immediately, even after hours.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I have your mobile. I will use it for true urgencies only.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'We are using the balance of this meeting to remove ambiguity, not to rush a false sense of completion.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I appreciate that. Short meetings are how these files get mangled.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Before we stop, list your homework items back to me in your own words.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I will list them now so we both hear the same list.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'And I will list mine — draft, diary, service plan, and what I still need from you.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'Then we are done only when both lists are clear.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Correct. Clarity beats speed on liability-sensitive work.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I am ready for the final lists whenever you are.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Let me also capture the correspondence channels used — email, WhatsApp, courier, and any hand deliveries — because service and proof later turn on that detail.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I can sort those channels. Some things were only on WhatsApp, which I know is messy, but I kept screenshots.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Screenshots help if we preserve context — timestamps, the prior message, and who was in the chat. Forward the export, not cropped fragments only.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I will export the full thread tonight. No cropping.'),
