    ('Speaker 1', 'Costs and disbursements — I will stage them so you approve each filing tranche.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'Please. No surprise filings.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'If urgent developments happen after we leave — lock-out, sale threat, new letter — call immediately, even after hours.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I have your mobile. I will use it for true urgencies only.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'We are using the balance of this meeting to remove ambiguity, not to rush a false sense of completion.'),
    ('Speaker 2', 'I appreciate that. Short meetings are how these files get mangled.'),
    ('Speaker 1', 'Before we stop, list your homework items back to me in your own words.'),
